# Dev CA state generated at runtime by CertService (cert_service.py) - .key/
# .pem are already covered above, but the issued certs + openssl serial file
# aren't, and this dir isn't meant to be checked in at all.
infrastructure/certs/issued/
infrastructure/certs/*.srl

